[{"client_msg_id":"6bf76e1b-9c77-4268-a1e6-b6b3a7477c17","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"あとちらっと grep の終了ステータスの話見ましたが、\nシェル使う上の文字列判定で終了ステータス重宝します。\n```if docker ps -q | grep -q $container_hash ; then \n  # $container_hash のコンテナが起動中なら処理\nfi```","ts":"1615615634.034500","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1615615655.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R5u6s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1c84507-6484-4f23-90b8-5adb668c481b","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"`git log` は git というファイルシステムを扱うための client コマンドなので、pipe にわたすことが前提の場合\n`git rev-list` 使うのが個人的なベストプラクティスですね。\nrev-list で hash だけが返ってくるので `cat-file` で内容を pipe に渡す感じです。\n```git rev-list HEAD | while read -r hash ; do\n    git cat-file -p $hash | awesome-command ...\ndone```","ts":"1615615461.031900","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1615615972.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qf+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6936bec6-9fac-4c0c-b3d8-a7b50e47dced","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"seqはとにかく、1つづつだから?\nバッファの管理を完全にシェルにまかせるから?","ts":"1615608922.028300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FCcT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e53d2e0-47d7-45eb-a682-75fa15634f22","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"PIPEっぽいところを書いてるのはここなんですが、これで対処できている。。？\n\u003chttps://github.com/coreutils/coreutils/blob/9de1d153f82243aeaaf19b0e5da2345f9b8652e3/src/seq.c#L290-L296\u003e","ts":"1615608163.027700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: coreutils/coreutils","id":1,"title":"coreutils/coreutils","title_link":"https://github.com/coreutils/coreutils/blob/9de1d153f82243aeaaf19b0e5da2345f9b8652e3/src/seq.c#L290-L296","text":"upstream mirror. Contribute to coreutils/coreutils development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4958508?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/coreutils/coreutils/blob/9de1d153f82243aeaaf19b0e5da2345f9b8652e3/src/seq.c#L290-L296","original_url":"https://github.com/coreutils/coreutils/blob/9de1d153f82243aeaaf19b0e5da2345f9b8652e3/src/seq.c#L290-L296"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lRd/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d27cf588-6846-4614-bfee-744275a2b1ab","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/yz2cm/items/8440ffd4bd88e321b3e0\u003e\nこれ、seqはSIGPIPEの処理をしてるってことなんですかね。。うーん。謎。\n```$ seq 100000 | sed 1q; echo $?\n1\n0\n\n$ seq 10000000 | sed 1q; echo $?\n1\n0\n\n$ seq 1000000000 | sed 1q; echo $?\n1\n0```","ts":"1615608093.027400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: パイプ処理における遅延評価の問題（SIGPIPE問題） - Qiita","id":1,"title":"パイプ処理における遅延評価の問題（SIGPIPE問題） - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/yz2cm/items/8440ffd4bd88e321b3e0","text":"パイプ処理における問題といえば、例のcat file | while readの同一変数が別コンテキストになる問題でしょ？と思われたかもしれないですが、それとはまた別のお話でして。 seq 1 1000 | head -10 上...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-1.2.2\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-1.2.2%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3D%25E3%2583%2591%25E3%2582%25A4%25E3%2583%2597%25E5%2587%25A6%25E7%2590%2586%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2581%258A%25E3%2581%2591%25E3%2582%258B%25E9%2581%2585%25E5%25BB%25B6%25E8%25A9%2595%25E4%25BE%25A1%25E3%2581%25AE%25E5%2595%258F%25E9%25A1%258C%25EF%25BC%2588SIGPIPE%25E5%2595%258F%25E9%25A1%258C%25EF%25BC%2589%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3De9a1b6398993510488